    "body": "Kinda, but then \"has cross-origin redirects\" needs to be state that Fetch maintains, I suspect. I'm also confused by \"navigate an iframe\" as I suspect some of those steps also need to apply to `embed` and `object` and processing the final response doesn't just result in a report but also needs to actually render something and such.",
