    "body": "Yeah that seems reasonable. And since we copy request's URL list over to the eventual response we might be able to reuse part of https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-request-tainted-origin somehow.\r\n\r\n(Apologies for taking so long. In the future please bug me on Matrix if I'm not responsive. Or ask the design question there as others might be able to answer as well.)",
